{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "96cea556-df4f-87ab-bf96-300f6ba9329d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:53:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gina Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:52:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:52:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's full again, right to the top, and nothing's going down. I told you people how it gets after the storm, and it's three days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:52:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, ma'am, I'm just picking up. Can I get your name and where you're calling about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gina Conti, 333 Annandale Road. The storm drain on the corner, by my building. It's full to the top, not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:52:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 333 Annandale, North End. Is that from the nor'easter Friday into Saturday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:52:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that one. I went out there myself this afternoon and pulled the leaves off the grate by hand. It worked for maybe ten minutes and then it filled right back up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:52:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good for you for trying, but please don't stand in the road doing that. Is water getting toward the building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's sitting in the street. I called after hours, I know, City Hall's closed, but the recording said this line takes storm calls. So I'm calling. Do the crews come out on the weekend? Because this has been sitting since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:53:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do work storm cleanup when they need to, but I can't give you a day. I'm putting this in as a drain that's fully blocked and not draining, so it gets looked at. Is 401-555-0182 the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. I'm home all day anyway. I've had my cooking show on all week, that Italian one, and I can't even enjoy it, I keep going to the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:53:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. It's logged, Mrs. Conti. Someone will follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T19:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, dear."
    }
  ],
